--- # Matches the style already used across src/: 2-space indent, attached
# braces, left-aligned pointers/references, includes grouped by blank lines
# (own header / C headers / C++ std headers / Qt & project headers) and
# sorted within each group. Google's base style already covers all of that;
# the only real deviation here is a wider column limit.
BasedOnStyle: Google
ColumnLimit: 120
